~ Overworld
Apple Devil: ...
- Talk
	=> Talk
- Pickpocket
- Fight
	do player.BeginBattle(self)
- Leave
	The poor mans screams are not your concern.
=> END

~ Talk
Apple Devil: ...
- What Are You?
	Apple Devil: You come see me, a great beast clearly born in the pools of hell chewing a weak, helpless man, and you ask what I am?
	Apple Devil: Clearly your intelligence fails you, now do not bother my meal unless you wish to be next.
	=> Talk
- Stop Eating Them [if player.GetStat(3) >= 0 && !interactions["Confronted"]]
	set interactions["Confronted"] = true
	Apple Devil: Wonderful, human morality your need to care for another...
	Apple Devil: and yet I am not a man so why should it apply to me?
	Apple Devil: Now let me ask you, this man wears robes of the sea, the ones who brought you here to die..
	Apple Devil: So do you truly care what happens to him, or are they just empty platitudes?
	- Yes, Let Him Go
		Apple Devil: Magnificent, Fabulous, Stupendous...
		Apple Devil: You are a prime example of your species.
		Apple Devil: Now obviously I will not give up my meal just because of your words...
		Apple Devil: But I would love to have a taste of your empathy if you'd like to make a deal.
		set interactions["AllowContract"] = true
		=> Talk
	- No, Leave
		Apple Devil: You are truly human.
		=> Talk
- Contract [if interactions["AllowContract"] == true]
	Apple Devil: I offer you a contract. In exchange for a small slither of your emotional intelligence...
	Apple Devil: I will give you my seed.
	- Accept
		if player.GetStat(3) >= 0
			You are given an [color=red]Apple Seed[/color]!
			=> Talk
		else
			You barely have anything left to offer, the deals off.
			=> Talk
	- Decline
		Apple Devil: So be it.
		=> Talk
- I Will Eat You
	Apple Devil: Curious, to have the gall to come across me consuming your fellow man and not care,
	Apple Devil: But to threaten me? Perhaps you are a devil yourself...
	Apple Devil: And while tearing you apart would be simple, consuming your vile soul is valueless...
	Apple Devil: Now leave while I have my patience and do not bother me again.
	do relation.SetAppleRep(-5)
	=> END
- Return
	=> Overworld